ook><name>KAWAMURA TAKAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MANABE AKIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA REFRIGERATION</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHASHI YOSHIKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAMURA, TAKAO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MANABE, AKIHIKO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MATSUSHITA REFRIGERATION COMPANY</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHASHI, YOSHIKI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAWAMURA TAKAO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MANABE AKIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHASHI YOSHIKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAWAMURA, TAKAO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MANABE, AKIHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHASHI, YOSHIKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A refrigerator, wherein a cooling compartment (90), a vegetable compartment (91), and a refrigerating compartment (92) are provided in order from the upper side, a compressor (104) and a cooler (106) are provided behind the refrigerating compartment (92) in parallel with each other in lateral direction, also a damper device (115) and a blower (114) are provided over the compressor (104) and the cooler (106), respectively, and an electronic control substrate (128) is provided behind the cooler (106) and, in addition, a cool air discharge path (116) and a cool air suction path (121) are provided at both bottom end parts inside the cooling compartment (90).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Cette invention concerne un réfrigérateur dans lequel un compartiment froid (90), un compartiment pour légumes (91) et un freeezer (92) sont superposés de haut en bas dans l'ordre indiqué. Derrière le freezer (92) se trouvent un compresseur (104) et un refroidisseur (106) disposés parallèlement l'un à l'autre dans le sens latéral. Au-dessus du compresseur (104) et du refroidisseur (106) se trouvent respectivement un dispositif amortisseur (115) et un ventilateur (114). Un substrat (128) pour commande électronique est implanté derrière le refroidisseur (106). De plus, le compartiment froid (90) comporte à ses deux extrémités inférieures un passage pour décharge d'air froid (116) et un autre passage pour aspiration d'air froid (121).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>